FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

PETROV
(serious)
The convoy carries copies of the ledgers. The mountain pass will close when the storm reaches the ridge.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

LENKA
(measured)
The enemy knows what is in those trucks. Expect attacks at both ends of the route.

COMMANDER SAVA
(firm)
Get the convoy through before the weather closes the pass. Protect the records even if the rear guard must fall back.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
